@@ -1,3 +1,12 @@
+Version 2.3.003-WRV-XP-1
+    Added a source-guarded Paper green-bar XP bonus that stacks the Together multiplier with the WeekendXP event rate
+    Preserved fractional green-bar bonuses across pickups and reconnects instead of rounding every small orb down
+    Added a live XP bonus indicator with separate skill and green-bar rates when they differ
+    Fixed fractional skill XP being truncated by the pre-XP event and honored that event's cancellation
+    Excluded offline party members from the Together proximity check
+    (API) Added raw float accessors to McMMOPlayerPreXpGainEvent while retaining the legacy integer methods
+    (API) Added runtime vanilla XP event multiplier and capability methods for WeekendXP integration
+
 Version 2.3.003
     Added an optional party Together bonus: extra skill XP from gameplay when party members play near each other (Party.Together_Bonus in config.yml, off by default; party leveling XP is not boosted)
     Added permission node mcmmo.perks.partybonus (default true)
